  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Maldives Tax Partnership Program (MTPP) aims to build a strong and effective working relationship between the Australian Tax Office (ATO) and the Maldives Inland Revenue Authority (MIRA), and support MIRA in its work to implement a strong, transparent and effective tax compliance regime in the Republic of Maldives.</narrative>
